The authorship-placeholder footnote must be resolved. The supplement and provenance statements must match what readers can actually access. Primitive-vector wording should be repaired at the same release pass. These are targeted repairs; a new general DJ optimum, an all-size Simon theorem, or the optional rank characterization is not required.

